nderstands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le03ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Key Life Events"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Life events are important things that happen during your life. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use expressions like<span class=\"italic\"> life-changing</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Did you know that \u2026 ?</span> to talk about key life events.<br />   You use an expression like <span class=\"italic\">someday</span> to talk about a life event in the future. You cannot be sure about it."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Event </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Expressions </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"first day of school/work<br /> birthday<br /> graduation<br /> getting a job<br /> starting a business<br /> promotion<br /> wedding <br /> having kids<br /> anniversary (10th/25th)<br /> retiring \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"memorable<br />  eventful<br /> life-changing<br /> Did you know that \u2026 ?<br /> I/It was so \u2026 <br /> When was the last time \u2026 ?<br /> someday\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Future Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you use the Future tense in the affirmative form, you can use the auxiliary <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.<br />   <span class=\"italic\">Structure</span>: will + base form of the verb<br /> <span class=\"italic\">Short Form</span>:  \u2018ll + base form of the verb"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use this form to:<ul>  \t<li>make a prediction:<br />  <span class=\"italic\">It will be an exciting year for you.</span> </li> \t<li>make an offer to do something for someone else in the future:<br /> <span class=\"italic\">I will buy you a ticket for your birthday.</span></li> \t<li> talk about decision made now:<br /> <span class=\"italic\">I will send you photos of my trip.</span></li> </ul>   \t\t\t"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "graduation "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the completion of a university degree or high school "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My graduation is coming up soon.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about life events."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to move out "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to go live in a different place "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to move out when I'm done school.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "on my own "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "alone "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm going to live on my own.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "performance evaluation "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a discussion about how well you are doing your job "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have a performance evaluation next week.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"